Package: catcheR
Type: Package
Title: Plasmid Library Sequencing Analysis for shRNA CATCHER Experiments
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-05-18
Authors@R: person("Elisa", "Balmas",
    email = "elisa.balmas@unito.it",
    role  = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: End-to-end quality control and analysis of shRNA plasmid library
    sequencing data produced by the CATCHER / iPS2-seq protocol (HEDGe lab,
    UNITO). Provides R wrappers for plasmid library QC (step1QC, step2QC),
    10X single-cell barcode assignment (10Xcatch, 10XcatchQC), cell filtering
    (filtercatch), empty cell identification (nocatch), barcode swap
    correction (sortcatch), a native R 10x entry point (tenxcatch,
    tenx_filtercatch, tenx_nocatch, tenx_seurat), the Fluent PIPseq port
    (pipcatch, pip_filtercatch, pip_nocatch, pip_seurat), the Parse Evercode
    port (parsecatch, parse_filtercatch, parse_nocatch, parse_seurat),
    chemistry-independent threshold diagnostics (call_accuracy,
    threshold_sweep) and a cross-chemistry comparison
    (compare_chemistries). All functions run natively without Docker.
